# TibiaMaps runtime assets — ~3300 binary files copied from the installed TibiaVision
# (see Resources/README.md). They are build-copied Content (PreserveNewest) that lives in the
# working dir next to the source; they must NOT be committed. Resources/README.md IS tracked.
Resources/minimap/
Resources/creatures/
Resources/npcs/
Resources/map/
# The 20 marker_NN.png pin icons, copied from the installed TibiaVision's
# Resources/Icons/MapMarkers. Content-copied to output by the Resources/** glob; not committed.
Resources/Icons/MapMarkers/
